| logical_plan  | Sort: cnt ASC NULLS LAST, state ASC NULLS LAST, fetch=100                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                              |
|               |   Projection: a.ca_state AS state, count(Int64(1)) AS cnt                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                              |
|               |     Filter: count(Int64(1)) >= Int64(10)                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                               |
|               |       Aggregate: groupBy=[[a.ca_state]], aggr=[[count(Int64(1))]]                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                      |
|               |         Projection: a.ca_state                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                         |
|               |           Inner Join: s.ss_item_sk = i.i_item_sk                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                       |
|               |             Projection: a.ca_state, s.ss_item_sk                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                       |
|               |               Federated                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                |
|               |  Projection: a.ca_address_sk, a.ca_state, c.c_customer_sk, c.c_current_addr_sk, s.ss_sold_date_sk, s.ss_item_sk, s.ss_customer_sk, d.d_date_sk, d.d_month_seq                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                          |
|               |   Inner Join:  Filter: s.ss_sold_date_sk = d.d_date_sk                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                 |
|               |     Inner Join:  Filter: c.c_customer_sk = s.ss_customer_sk                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                            |
|               |       Inner Join:  Filter: a.ca_address_sk = c.c_current_addr_sk                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                       |
|               |         SubqueryAlias: a                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                               |
|               |           TableScan: customer_address projection=[ca_address_sk, ca_state]                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                             |
|               |         SubqueryAlias: c                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                               |
|               |           TableScan: customer projection=[c_customer_sk, c_current_addr_sk]                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                            |
|               |       SubqueryAlias: s                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                 |
|               |         TableScan: store_sales projection=[ss_sold_date_sk, ss_item_sk, ss_customer_sk]                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                |
|               |     Filter: d.d_month_seq = (<subquery>)                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                               |
|               |       Subquery:                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                        |
|               |         Distinct:                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                      |
|               |           Projection: date_dim.d_month_seq                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                             |
|               |             TableScan: date_dim, full_filters=[date_dim.d_year = Int64(1998), date_dim.d_moy = Int64(3)]                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                               |
|               |       SubqueryAlias: d                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                 |
|               |         TableScan: date_dim projection=[d_date_sk, d_month_seq]                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                        |
|               |             Projection: i.i_item_sk                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                    |
|               |               LeftSemi Join: i.i_category = __scalar_sq_1.i_category Filter: CAST(i.i_current_price AS Decimal128(30, 15)) > CAST(Float64(1.2) * __scalar_sq_1.avg(j.i_current_price) AS Decimal128(30, 15))                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                           |
|               |                 Federated                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                              |
|               |  Projection: i.i_item_sk, i.i_current_price, i.i_category                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                              |
|               |   SubqueryAlias: i                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                     |
|               |     TableScan: item projection=[i_item_sk, i_current_price, i_category]                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                |
